Third-party engines are invoked as separate processes and are NOT bundled:

- Calibre (ebook-convert) — GPL-3.0. Optional runtime dependency; installed by
  the user or the full Docker image. See docs/LICENSES.md.
- Pandoc — GPL-2.0-or-later. Optional runtime dependency.
- Tesseract OCR — Apache-2.0. Optional runtime dependency.

npm dependencies keep their own licenses; run `npx license-checker --summary`
or see docs/LICENSES.md for the generated inventory.
